She runs like spring again — next check-up is on us.</p><div class="sc-fade"></div></div><button type="button" class="sc-x" aria-expanded="false"><span>Expand</span><svg class="ic chev" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 3.8 4.2 4.2L6 12.2"></path></svg></button></article><article class="scast" style="--sc-est: 200px;" data-sid="alpenbahn" data-unseen="1"><div class="sc-head"><div class="sc-line"><b>Alpenbahn</b><span class="addr"><span>tickets@alpenbahn.ch</span></span><span class="amt num">CHF 52.00</span><span class="t num">Mon 13:55</span></div><h3>Dein Billett Winterthur–Lugano</h3></div><div class="sc-clip"><p class="sc-body msg-plain">Winterthur → Lugano
Di 12. August · Abfahrt 08:02 · Ankunft 11:24

1 × 2. Klasse — CHF 52.00
Bezahlt mit der hinterlegten Karte.

Sitzplatz 44, Fenster, Seeseite — die schöne Hälfte der Strecke gehört dir.</p><div class="sc-fade"></div></div><button type="button" class="sc-x" aria-expanded="false"><span>Expand</span><svg class="ic chev" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 3.8 4.2 4.2L6 12.2"></path></svg></button></article><div aria-hidden="true" data-stream-tail="true" style="height: 220px;"></div></div></section></div></main></div></div></div><div class="toast-slot" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>"
`;

