le="overflow-anchor: none;"><div class="rows" role="listbox" aria-label="Triage"><div aria-hidden="true" data-window-top="" style="height: 0px;"></div><button type="button" class="row srow seen sel" data-id="nadja" data-index="0" aria-label="Nadja Lehner: Would you teach the September glaze evening?" aria-description="Mon 27 Jul 2026, 13:49 · Read" aria-describedby=":rID:" role="option" aria-setsize="2" aria-posinset="1" aria-selected="true" tabindex="0"><span class="av tinted" aria-hidden="true" style="--av-h: 150;">N</span><span class="sr-main"><span class="row-top"><span class="who">Nadja Lehner</span><span class="addr"><span>nadja@erdton-atelier.example</span></span><span class="t num tog" title="Mon 27 Jul 2026, 13:49" data-stamp="">Mon 13:49</span></span><span class="row-mid"><span class="subj">Would you teach the September glaze evening?</span></span><span class="prev" style="display: block;">Two hours, twelve people — and your matte white is why they're asking.</span></span><span id=":rID:" hidden="" aria-label="Mon 27 Jul 2026, 13:49 · Read"></span></button><button type="button" class="row srow seen" data-id="jonas" data-index="1" aria-label="Jonas Halter: Open studio in October — which weekend?" aria-description="Fri 24 Jul 2026, 13:48 · Read" aria-describedby=":rID:" role="option" aria-setsize="2" aria-posinset="2" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1"><span class="av tinted" aria-hidden="true" style="--av-h: 150;">J</span><span class="sr-main"><span class="row-top"><span class="who">Jonas Halter</span><span class="addr"><span>jonas@lichtgrat.example</span></span><span class="t num tog" title="Fri 24 Jul 2026, 13:48" data-stamp="">Fri 13:48</span></span><span class="row-mid"><span class="subj">Open studio in October — which weekend?</span></span><span class="prev" style="display: block;">The 11th or the 18th. I'll do the rest, I just need the date.</span></span><span id=":rID:" hidden="" aria-label="Fri 24 Jul 2026, 13:48 · Read"></span></button></div></div><div class="col-handle col-handle-list" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical" aria-label="List width" aria-valuemin="320" aria-valuemax="320" aria-valuenow="400" tabindex="0"></div></div><div class="read-col" role="region" aria-label="Open message" tabindex="-1"><article class="msg" data-conv-id="nadja" data-body-ready=""><div class="msg-from"><button type="button" class="msg-sender" title="Screening for nadja@erdton-atelier.example" aria-label="Screening for nadja@erdton-atelier.example"><span class="av s tinted" aria-hidden="true" style="--av-h: 150;">N</span><b>Nadja Lehner</b><small><span class="addr-text"><span class="addr-local">nadja</span><span class="addr-dom">@erdton<span class="addr-nb">-a</span>telier.example</span></span></small></button><span class="t num"><span class="msg-menu"><button type="button" class="msg-more" aria-haspopup="menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Message actions" title="Message actions"><span aria-hidden="true">⋯</span></button></span><button type="button" class="stamp-toggle" aria-pressed="false"><time datetime="2026-07-27T11:49:00.000Z" title="Mon 27 Jul 2026, 13:49">Mon 13:49</time></button></span><p class="msg-from-line">from nadja@erdton-atelier.example</p></div><p class="msg-subject" role="heading" aria-level="2"><button type="button" class="subj-rule">Would you teach the September glaze evening?</button></p><div class="msg-marks"><div class="msg-signals"><span class="chip" data-chip="rationale"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 12px; height: 12px;"><circle cx="3.4" cy="12.6" r="1.6"></circle><circle cx="12.6" cy="3.4" r="1.6"></circle><path d="M4.8 11.4c2.6-1 5.6-4 6.6-6.6"></path></svg>Ohbox — you said Yes to this sender</span></div></div><div class="msg-body"><p class="msg-p msg-plain">Hi Mila</p><p class="msg-p msg-plain">You were at «Glaze &amp; Fire» in August, and three people have since asked us who made the matte white bowls on your table. So — would you teach the September glaze evening?</p><p class="msg-p msg-plain">Two hours, twelve people, Thursday the 18th or the 25th, whichever suits you. Materials and firing are ours; tell me what you'd want for the evening itself.</p><p class="msg-p msg-plain">No rush, but I'd like the programme at the printer by the end of next week.</p><p class="msg-p msg-plain">Nadja
Atelier Erdton</p><span data-own-end="" aria-hidden="true" class="own-end"></span></div><div class="msg-actions"><div class="abar"><div class="abar-row"><div class="abar-g"><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-solo primary abar-reply" aria-label="Reply" aria-keyshortcuts="r"><svg class="ic abar-ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"><path d="M6.4 4.2 2.8 7.8l3.6 3.6M3 7.8h6.4a3.8 3.8 0 0 1 3.8 3.8v.6"></path></svg><span class="abar-reply-lab">Reply</span><kbd aria-hidden="true">r</kbd></button></div><div class="abar-g abar-fwd"><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-solo" aria-label="Forward" aria-keyshortcuts="Shift+F"><svg class="ic abar-ico" viewBox="0 0 16 16" aria-hidden="true" style="width: 14px; height: 14px;"><path d="m9.6 4.2 3.6 3.6-3.6 3.6M13 7.8H6.6a3.8 3.8 0 0 0-3.8 3.8v.6"></path></svg><span class="abar-fwd-lab">Forward</span><kbd aria-hidden="true">⇧ f</kbd></button></div><div class="abar-g abar-seg abar-defer" role="group" aria-label="Not now"><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-v abar-later" aria-pressed="true" aria-keyshortcuts="a">Later<kbd aria-hidden="true">a</kbd></button><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-v abar-aside" aria-pressed="false" aria-keyshortcuts="e">Park<kbd aria-hidden="true">e</kbd></button><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-v abar-resurface" aria-pressed="false" aria-keyshortcuts="b">Resurface<kbd aria-hidden="true">b</kbd></button></div><div class="abar-g abar-v abar-tag"><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-solo" aria-keyshortcuts="t">Tag<kbd aria-hidden="true">t</kbd></button></div><div class="abar-g abar-seg abar-file" role="group" aria-label="File it"><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-v abar-screen" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" aria-keyshortcuts="s">Screening<kbd aria-hidden="true">s</kbd></button><button type="button" class="abar-b abar-v abar-move" aria-keyshortcuts="m">Move<kbd aria-hidden="true">m</kbd></button></div><div class="ab